# Netlify API & Uploads Proxy
# Once your FastAPI backend is deployed, replace https://YOUR-ACTUAL-BACKEND-DOMAIN
# with your actual backend URL (e.g. https://mayavi-api.onrender.com).
# This transparently proxies all /api/* and /uploads/* requests from https://klmayavi.in
# directly to your backend, avoiding all CORS issues and third-party cookie restrictions.

/api/*  https://YOUR-ACTUAL-BACKEND-DOMAIN/api/:splat  200!
/uploads/*  https://YOUR-ACTUAL-BACKEND-DOMAIN/uploads/:splat  200!
